  "content": "<p><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/znHQQtuU/images/653b6f24f05341edcd3cba3164edd0b8d2c0dd71.png\" alt=\"更多樂趣\" width=\"408\" height=\"111\"></p><p><strong>展開更豐富的烹飪之旅</strong>，More Delight 是一款農夫樂事模組的擴充模組，新增更多菜餚、刀具與食材。</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/more-delight-fabric/files/all?page=1&amp;pageSize=20&amp;version=26.1\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/ZmYDVgW.png\" alt=\"下載 26.1 更新\" width=\"217\" height=\"36\"></a> <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/more-delight-forge\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/v9HxDzV.png\" alt=\"Forge 下載\" width=\"248\" height=\"36\"></a></p><h2>🍽️ 特色</h2><ul>\n<li>以全新菜餚與食材擴充您的菜單。</li>\n<li>輕鬆使用吐司片製作三明治。</li>\n<li>享受用吐司片製作的酥脆烤吐司。</li>\n<li>裝備木刀與石刀，享受精準烹飪樂趣。</li>\n</ul><h2>🛠️ 相容模組</h2><ul>\n<li>Expanded Delight</li>\n<li>Casualness Delight</li>\n<li>Supplementaries</li>\n<li>Create</li>\n<li>Some Assembly Required</li>\n</ul><p>其中許多菜餚靈感來自於我女朋友烹煮的美味料理。<br><br></p><p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fpaypal.me%252fkevgelhorn\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/9rlXSyLg/images/491c87c96cd602ec45774ce0b0cb9fe4d25ba074.png\" alt=\"為筆電存錢中！\" width=\"1150\" height=\"227\"></a></p><p><a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/Axperty\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/intergrav/devins-badges/refs/heads/v3/assets/cozy/donate/patreon-singular_64h.png\" alt=\"贊助我按鈕\"></a><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fpaypal.me%252fkevgelhorn\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/intergrav/devins-badges/refs/heads/v3/assets/cozy/donate/paypal-singular_64h.png\" alt=\"捐款按鈕\"></a></p>",
